2026-09-20

Same fake tool call as exec-approve-for-me.jsonl (`{"cmd": "touch <path outside the
workspace>"}`, same fake server instance, same reused port), but with
`--dangerously-bypass-approvals-and-sandbox` instead of `--approve-for-me`: no prompt, no
sandbox denial — the `command_execution` item completes with `exit_code:0`, and the file
existed on disk afterward. The scratch path in this file's `command` field was rewritten
from `/var/tmp/tack-measure/wave1/m1` to `/capture`.
